{
  "$comment": [
    "Opt-in hooks. Install with `ws hooks install`, remove with `ws hooks remove`.",
    "They record AGENT working hours automatically, so the numbers do not depend on",
    "anyone remembering. Human hours stay manual on purpose: `ws clock in/out`.",
    "`ws agent auto` never fails and records nothing when it cannot tell which",
    "project the session belongs to - an hour on the wrong project is worse than none."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": ".agents/bin/ws agent auto in || true" }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": ".agents/bin/ws agent auto out || true" }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
